   "claims": [
    "To get the result, you just need to set the unit of distance to \"miles\" and enter \"1\".",
    "Then, you'll see the number of steps — \"2,400\" for females and \"2,112\" for males.",
    "It uses the following steps to miles conversion formula: distance / stride length = steps As we said, the average stride length for women hovers around 2.2 ft, and it will be the stride length in our example.",
    "To convert steps to miles: Determine the stride length - measure it or assume 2.2 ft if you're female and 2.5 ft if you're male.",
    "Use the following mile to steps conversion formula distance / stride length = steps: Convert a mile to feet : 1 mile = 5280 feet.",
    "Walking a mile means taking around 2,000 steps.",
    "If we assume an average stride length (2.2 ft for women and 2.5 ft for men), a mile will take 2,112 male steps and 2,400 female steps.",
    "Walking 3 miles means taking around 6-7 thousand steps.",
    "If we assume an average stride length (2.2 ft for women and 2.5 ft for men), 3 miles will take 6,336 male steps and 7,206 female steps.",
    "For a woman with an average stride length (2.2 ft), 10,000 steps are 4.163 mi, and for a man with an average step (2.5 ft), it's 4.735 mi."
   ],
